---
// FAQ (#faq), STRUCTURE.md §7. Native <details>, so it works without JS and every row can be open at
// once. Answers sit on parchment (V6-015). Every claim is checked in docs/v6/landing/NOTES.md
// ("V6-LAND-05", re-checked in "V6-LAND-06"): every answer is true of the game as merged today.
// Rewritten for web accounts, Telegram linking, key rebinding and in-app deletion (V6-060, v6 wrap-up).
// Styles: styles/below.css. No FAQPage JSON-LD: Google no longer shows FAQ results for sites like
// this one, and mobile LCP has no bytes to spare (V6-032).
---
<section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section__head">
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="section__title">Questions</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details>
        <summary>Is it free to play?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Yes. In Telegram, Stars buy Drachmae for cosmetics, the season pass and shortcuts; gear and heroes are never sold. Purchases are not available on the web yet.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need Telegram?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">No. The campaign plays in your browser with no account. Sign up with your email to play duels and the war on the web too. Already play in Telegram? Link the two and keep one account on both.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I play on a laptop or tablet?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Yes: phones, tablets and laptops, by touch or with mouse and keyboard, battle hotkeys included. You can rebind every key in Settings.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is my progress saved?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Your campaign saves on your device. With an account, on the web or in Telegram, it also syncs to the cloud, so you can carry on from another device. Duels and the war live on the server.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which languages?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">English and Russian.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens to my data?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Only what the game needs. Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>. You can delete your account and its data at any time in Settings, under Account; in Telegram, /delete_my_data takes you there.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
